---@field keys? ovh.cloud_v2.CreatePublicCloudProjectManagedDatabaseValkeyUserRequestKeysList Glob patterns of the keys the user can access (e.g. 'cache:*', 'session:user:42'). Use '*' to allow every key. When the list is empty, the user cannot access any key.
