---@field autoSuspendIdleSeconds? number|distilled.Null Number of seconds of inactivity before a sandboxed compute session is automatically suspended. Defaults to 60 seconds.
---@field baseUrl? string|distilled.Null Base URL of the remote command-execution service. No trailing slash.
---@field defaultImage? string|distilled.Null Default machine image used when the agent provisions a new sandboxed compute session.
---@field enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Master switch for remote command execution. When false, the agent cannot run shell commands.

