---@alias ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudAiAgentsFailoverPolicyOnEnum "AUTH"|"CLIENT_ERROR"|"CONTEXT_OVERFLOW"|"RATE_LIMIT"|"SERVER_ERROR"|"TRANSPORT"|"UNRECOVERABLE"

