---@field cni? ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudManagedKubernetesCniUpdate|distilled.Null Mutable CNI settings only. The CNI variant is immutable; its discriminant must not be sent.
---@field name string Cluster name. Not an identifier; can be changed after creation.
---@field network? ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudManagedKubernetesNetworkUpdate|distilled.Null Mutable network settings only. The network variant and its identifiers are immutable and must not be sent.
---@field version string Desired Kubernetes version, full (for example 1.34.1-2) or minor (for example 1.34). The current minor changes nothing; the next minor upgrades to its latest patch. Changing this drives a version upgrade reconciliation.

