---@class ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudManagedKubernetesKubeProxy
---@field iptables? ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudManagedKubernetesKubeProxyIptables|distilled.Null iptables mode payload. Provided when mode is IPTABLES; must be absent otherwise.
---@field ipvs? ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudManagedKubernetesKubeProxyIpvs|distilled.Null IPVS mode payload. Provided when mode is IPVS; must be absent otherwise.
