---Kube-proxy iptables mode settings.
---@class ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudManagedKubernetesKubeProxyIptables
---@field minSyncPeriod? string|distilled.Null The minimum period that iptables rules are refreshed, in RFC3339 duration format (e.g. 'PT60S')
---@field syncPeriod? string|distilled.Null The period that iptables rules are refreshed, in RFC3339 duration format (e.g. 'PT60S'). Must be greater than 0

---Kube-proxy IPVS mode settings.
---@class ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudManagedKubernetesKubeProxyIpvs
---@field minSyncPeriod? string|distilled.Null The minimum period that ipvs rules are refreshed in RFC3339 duration format (e.g. 'PT60S').
---@field scheduler? ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudManagedKubernetesKubeProxyIpvsSchedulerEnum|string|distilled.Null IPVS scheduling algorithm.
---@field syncPeriod? string|distilled.Null The period that ipvs rules are refreshed in RFC3339 duration format (e.g. 'PT60S'). Must be greater than 0.
---@field tcpFinTimeout? string|distilled.Null The timeout value used for IPVS TCP sessions after receiving a FIN in RFC3339 duration format (e.g. 'PT60S'). The default value is 'PT0S', which preserves the current timeout value on the system.
---@field tcpTimeout? string|distilled.Null The timeout value used for idle IPVS TCP sessions in RFC3339 duration format (e.g. 'PT60S'). The default value is 'PT0S', which preserves the current timeout value on the system. Cannot be set between 'PT0S' and 'PT5S', in order to prevent in-cluster networking issues.
---@field udpTimeout? string|distilled.Null The timeout value used for IPVS UDP packets in RFC3339 duration format (e.g. 'PT60S'). The default value is 'PT0S', which preserves the current timeout value on the system.

---Algorithm IPVS uses to pick the backend pod for a new connection. ROUND_ROBIN cycles through backends; LEAST_CONNECTION picks the backend with the fewest active connections; SHORTEST_EXPECTED_DELAY and NEVER_QUEUE weight the choice on expected latency; DESTINATION_HASHING and SOURCE_HASHING pin a connection to a backend based on the destination or source address.
---@alias ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudManagedKubernetesKubeProxyIpvsSchedulerEnum "DESTINATION_HASHING"|"LEAST_CONNECTION"|"NEVER_QUEUE"|"ROUND_ROBIN"|"SHORTEST_EXPECTED_DELAY"|"SOURCE_HASHING"

