---Update specification for the project quota
---@class ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudQuotaQuotaUpdateTargetSpec
---@field preventAutomaticQuotaUpgrade boolean When true, automatic quota upgrades are disabled for this project
---@field regions ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudQuotaQuotaUpdateTargetSpecRegionsList Target quota profile per region. Regions omitted are left unchanged. This is the one deliberate exception to the replace semantics every other update route on this API follows: the list is applied as an element-level upsert keyed by region, not as a whole-list replacement, so that raising the quota of one region does not force a caller to restate every other region of the project.

