---Target specification for a file storage
---@class ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudStorageFileFileStorageTargetSpec
---@field createFrom? ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudStorageFileFileStorageCreateFrom|distilled.Null Optional source to create the file storage from. Set at creation only; immutable. When omitted, an empty file storage is created
---@field description? string|distilled.Null Description of the file storage
---@field encryption? ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudStorageFileFileStorageEncryption|distilled.Null Encryption configuration for the file storage. Set at creation only; immutable. When `createFrom` is set, the encryption of the snapshot's source file storage is used and returned here: requesting `enabled` true from a snapshot of an unencrypted file storage is rejected as an invalid parameter, and requesting `enabled` false from a snapshot of an encrypted file storage is ignored, so the new file storage is encrypted
---@field location ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudCommonLocation Desired resource location. When `createFrom` is set, `region` must be the region of the snapshot
---@field name string Desired file storage name
