---
---Reserves `quantity` instances of a flavor in a region for `duration` (e.g. `P1Y`). In a 3-AZ region, set `location.availabilityZone` to choose the zone; when omitted, the zone with the most stock is chosen. Creation is **asynchronous**; once `READY`, create instances with the reserved flavor `currentState.flavor.id`.
