---Delete a group of your lakehouse.
---
---Deletes the group asynchronously. The response is the group in DELETING, with the deletion task in `currentTasks`. Once the deletion completes, the group and every route under it, its tasks included, answer 404. Deleting a group also deletes its role assignments and its members; the users themselves are kept. The deletion is refused with a 409 when it would remove the last Lakehouse Admin assignment of the lakehouse: assign the Lakehouse Admin role to another identity first.
---
---A deletion is accepted in READY and ERROR, and also in CREATING and UPDATING, where it replaces the change in progress. A new deletion while one is running is refused with a 409.
---
---`DELETE /publicCloud/project/{projectId}/managedAnalytics/lakehouse/{lakehouseId}/group/{groupId}`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound, Conflict.
