---Delete a custom role of your lakehouse.
---
---Deletes the custom role asynchronously. The response is the role in DELETING, with the deletion task in `currentTasks`. Once the deletion completes, the role and every route under it, its tasks included, answer 404. Deleting a role also deletes its role assignments: the identities that held it lose the access it gave them.
---
---A predefined role cannot be deleted: the deletion is refused with a 409.
---
---A deletion is accepted in READY and ERROR, and also in CREATING and UPDATING, where it replaces the change in progress. A new deletion while one is running is refused with a 409.
---
---`DELETE /publicCloud/project/{projectId}/managedAnalytics/lakehouse/{lakehouseId}/role/{roleId}`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input ovh.cloud_v2.DeletePublicCloudProjectManagedAnalyticsLakehouseRoleRequest
---@return ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudLakehouseRole? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_public_cloud_project_managed_analytics_lakehouse_role(input) end

---Delete a role assignment of your lakehouse.
---
---Deletes the role assignment asynchronously. The response is the role assignment in DELETING, with the deletion task in `currentTasks`. Once the deletion completes, the role assignment and every route under it, its tasks included, answer 404, and the identity no longer holds the role.
---
---The last Lakehouse Admin assignment of the lakehouse cannot be deleted: the deletion is refused with a 409 while it is the only role assignment of LAKEHOUSE_ADMIN that is not being deleted. Assign the Lakehouse Admin role to another identity first. The rule counts role assignments, not the people they reach: an assignment to an empty group counts.
---
---A deletion is accepted in READY and ERROR, and also in CREATING, where it replaces the change in progress. A new deletion while one is running is refused with a 409.
---
---`DELETE /publicCloud/project/{projectId}/managedAnalytics/lakehouse/{lakehouseId}/roleAssignment/{roleAssignmentId}`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input ovh.cloud_v2.DeletePublicCloudProjectManagedAnalyticsLakehouseRoleAssignmentRequest
---@return ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudLakehouseRoleAssignment? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_public_cloud_project_managed_analytics_lakehouse_role_assignment(input) end

