---Get the AI agent configuration settings fixed by OVHcloud
---
---Part of an AI agent's configuration is managed by OVHcloud rather than by you: how callers authenticate to the agent, and whether the agent can run code. This route says which parts those are, so a configuration can be prepared knowing what will be accepted — anything OVHcloud manages is rejected if you set it yourself, whether on an agent or on a template. What it reports does not change from one agent to the next.
---
---`GET /publicCloud/project/{projectId}/ai/agents/preset/globalSettings`
---@param input ovh.cloud_v2.GetPublicCloudProjectAiAgentPresetGlobalSettingsRequest
---@return ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudAiAgentsGlobalSettings? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_public_cloud_project_ai_agent_preset_global_settings(input) end

---Get the OVHcloud AI Endpoints provider preset
---
