---
---`GET /publicCloud/project/{projectId}/ai/agents/preset/model/aiEndpointsProvider`
---@param input ovh.cloud_v2.GetPublicCloudProjectAiAgentPresetModelAiEndpointsProviderRequest
---@return ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudAiAgentsAIEndpointsPreset? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_public_cloud_project_ai_agent_preset_model_ai_endpoints_provider(input) end

