---A preset is a ready-made configuration OVHcloud publishes, offered alongside the templates a caller writes for themselves. Pass its `id` as `targetSpec.template.id` on an agent creation to build an agent from it; the identifier carries a reserved prefix, so a client can tell a preset from a template of its own.
---
---`GET /publicCloud/project/{projectId}/ai/agents/preset/template/{templatePresetId}`
---@param input ovh.cloud_v2.GetPublicCloudProjectAiAgentPresetTemplateRequest
---@return ovh.cloud_v2.PublicCloudAiAgentsTemplatePreset? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_public_cloud_project_ai_agent_preset_template(input) end

